// fastfetch de pokefetch: la columna de la derecha (el pokémon lo pone pokefetch con --logo).
// Íconos de Nerd Font (Omarchy ya trae una). Uso de IA: ~/.local/bin/ai-usage, cacheado.
{
  "$schema": "https://github.com/fastfetch-cli/fastfetch/raw/dev/doc/json_schema.json",
  "logo": {
    "type": "none"
  },
  "display": {
    "separator": "  ",
    "color": {
      "keys": "magenta",
      "title": "cyan"
    },
    "key": {
      "width": 13
    },
    "size": {
      "binaryPrefix": "si"
    }
  },
  "modules": [
    {
      "type": "os",
      "key": " OS",
      "format": "{pretty-name} {arch}"
    },
    {
      "type": "kernel",
      "key": " Kernel"
    },
    {
      "type": "uptime",
      "key": "󰅐 Uptime"
    },
    {
      "type": "shell",
      "key": " Shell"
    },
    {
      "type": "terminal",
      "key": " Terminal"
    },
    {
      "type": "wm",
      "key": " WM"
    },
    {
      "type": "command",
      "key": "󰏘 Tema",
      "text": "omarchy-theme-current 2>/dev/null || cat ~/.local/state/omarchy/current/theme.name 2>/dev/null"
    },
    {
      "type": "cpu",
      "key": " CPU",
      "temp": true
    },
    {
      "type": "command",
      "key": "󰐝 Pokémon",
      "keyColor": "yellow",
      "text": "printf '%s' \"${POKEFETCH_NAME:--}\""
    },
    {
      "type": "command",
      "key": "󰚩 Claude",
      "keyColor": "yellow",
      "text": "ai-usage claude"
    },
    "break",
    {
      "type": "colors",
      "symbol": "circle"
    }
  ]
}
